scanne le filesystem avant d'appliquer .vercelignore, donc .gstack/ (verrouill\u00e9, Permission denied) provoque un EPERM. Solution \u00e9prouv\u00e9e : cloner le repo hors de l'arbre de travail et d\u00e9ployer avec `vercel --cwd` sur le clone, qui ne contient que le contenu committ\u00e9."}, {"id": "docs_handoff_vercel", "label": "D\u00e9ploiement Vercel \u2014 projet `rapia`, domaines ia.rapyogo.com / rapia.vercel.app", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_handoff_gsaptimelinepitfall", "label": "Pi\u00e8ge GSAP : ne pas utiliser tl.totalDuration(1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tl.totalDuration(1) r\u00e9\u00e9tale toutes les positions absolues de la timeline ; utiliser tl.to({}, {duration:0.01}, 0.99) \u00e0 la place pour caler la dur\u00e9e sans perturber le minutage des actes narratifs."}, {"id": "docs_handoff_lenis", "label": "Lenis \u2014 scroll fluide synchronis\u00e9 au ticker GSAP", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lenis doit \u00eatre avanc\u00e9 depuis le ticker GSAP (pas son propre rAF) pour \u00e9viter deux boucles concurrentes ; gsap.ticker.lagSmoothing(0) est obligatoire, et scroll-behavior:smooth a \u00e9t\u00e9 retir\u00e9 de globals.css car il se dispute les ancres avec Lenis."}, {"id": "docs_handoff_nextintl", "label": "Bilinguisme FR/EN via next-intl v4 (171 cl\u00e9s, parit\u00e9 stricte)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "messages/*.json est l'unique source de v\u00e9rit\u00e9 de la copy ; toute cl\u00e9 ajout\u00e9e en FR doit exister en EN, v\u00e9rifi\u00e9 par un script Node comparant les arborescences de cl\u00e9s."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "lib_email", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "docs_handoff_emaillayout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "docs_handoff_validatebeforeratelimit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "specs_honeypot", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "specs_ratelimiting", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "readme_brevo_quota", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "specs_resendmigration", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "docs_handoff_gstackworkaround", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_handoff", "target": "docs_handoff_vercel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "con